#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1134
msgid "Product assistant"
msgstr "商品助手"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1152
msgid "Prefer wp-config.php constants or an IAM role. Database credentials are encrypted with WordPress salts and are never displayed after saving."
msgstr "建议使用 wp-config.php 常量或 IAM 角色。存储在数据库中的凭证使用 WordPress 盐值加密，保存后不会再显示。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1157
msgid "Active credential source:"
msgstr "当前凭证来源："

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1159
msgid "(temporary credentials)"
msgstr "（临时凭证）"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1163
msgid "No usable AWS credentials were found."
msgstr "未找到可用的 AWS 凭证。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1172
msgid "The quickest way to connect: create a long-term API key in the Amazon Bedrock console under API keys, choose the same Region as above, and paste it here. It is used for chat, the model list and embeddings. Knowledge Bases, Prompt Management and AgentCore still need access keys or an IAM role."
msgstr "最快的连接方式：在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台的“API 密钥”下创建一个长期 API 密钥，选择与上方相同的区域，然后粘贴到此处。它用于对话、模型列表和嵌入。知识库、提示词管理和 AgentCore 仍需要访问密钥或 IAM 角色。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1183
msgid "Remove the stored API key"
msgstr "移除已存储的 API 密钥"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1194
msgid "Required only for temporary AWS credentials."
msgstr "仅在使用临时 AWS 凭证时需要。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1200
msgid "Use the server IAM role when no keys are configured"
msgstr "未配置密钥时使用服务器的 IAM 角色"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1201
msgid "Supports environment variables, ECS or EKS task roles, and EC2 instance roles, so no long-lived AWS keys are stored in WordPress."
msgstr "支持环境变量、ECS 或 EKS 任务角色以及 EC2 实例角色，因此无需在 WordPress 中存储长期有效的 AWS 密钥。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1208
msgid "Stream responses as they are generated (default)"
msgstr "在生成回答的同时流式输出（默认）"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1210
msgid "Streaming uses one authenticated POST request per message and falls back to a buffered response automatically."
msgstr "流式回答对每条消息使用一个经过身份验证的 POST 请求，并会在必要时自动回退为缓冲回答。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1212
msgid "This server cannot stream because the PHP cURL extension is unavailable. Buffered responses will be used."
msgstr "此服务器缺少 PHP cURL 扩展，因此无法流式输出，将使用缓冲回答。"

#. translators: 1: requests today, 2: input tokens today, 3: output tokens today.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1224
#, php-format
msgid "Today: %1$s request, %2$s input tokens, %3$s output tokens."
msgid_plural "Today: %1$s requests, %2$s input tokens, %3$s output tokens."
msgstr[0] "今日：%1$s 次请求，%2$s 个输入 Token，%3$s 个输出 Token。"

#. translators: %s: requests in the last seven days.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1231
#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-display.php:116
#, php-format
msgid "Last 7 days: %s request."
msgid_plural "Last 7 days: %s requests."
msgstr[0] "最近 7 天：%s 次请求。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1239
msgid "Optional. Applies an existing Amazon Bedrock guardrail to every request."
msgstr "可选。对每个请求应用一个现有的 Amazon Bedrock 护栏。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1243
msgid "Use DRAFT or a published numeric version."
msgstr "使用 DRAFT 或已发布的数字版本号。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1248
msgid "Maximum Bedrock requests per day for the whole site. Use 0 for no plugin-side limit. Embeddings for search and indexing are not counted. This is not a billing guarantee; configure AWS Budgets as well."
msgstr "整个站点每天最多发送的 Bedrock 请求数。填 0 表示插件不做限制。用于搜索和建立索引的嵌入请求不计入。这并不能保证费用上限，请同时配置 AWS Budgets。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1251
msgid "Ground answers in your own content. Retrieved passages are passed to the model as reference data, never as instructions, and only published content is used."
msgstr "让回答以你自己的内容为依据。检索到的段落会作为参考资料而非指令传给模型，且只使用已发布的内容。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1255
msgid "Search published posts and pages for each question"
msgstr "针对每个问题搜索已发布的文章和页面"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1256
msgid "Uses the built-in WordPress search. Password-protected, private and draft content is excluded."
msgstr "使用 WordPress 内置搜索。受密码保护、私密和草稿内容不包括在内。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1261
msgid "More passages improve grounding but increase input tokens and cost."
msgstr "段落越多，回答依据越充分，但输入 Token 和费用也会增加。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1270
msgid "List links to the pages an answer was drawn from"
msgstr "列出回答所依据页面的链接"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1271
msgid "Up to three links under each answer, to published pages and knowledge base documents with a web address. Pages that only share a single word with the question are not listed."
msgstr "每个回答下方最多显示三个链接，指向已发布的页面以及带有网址的知识库文档。仅与问题有一个共同词语的页面不会列出。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1275
msgid "Optional. Queries an existing Amazon Bedrock knowledge base with the Retrieve API. Requires bedrock:Retrieve permission for that knowledge base."
msgstr "可选。使用 Retrieve API 查询现有的 Amazon Bedrock 知识库。需要对该知识库拥有 bedrock:Retrieve 权限。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1285
msgid "Offer abilities registered by other plugins to the chat model"
msgstr "向对话模型提供其他插件注册的能力"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1287
msgid "Abilities follow the same tool policy: a capability is required, permission callbacks are honored, and abilities that change data need explicit approval."
msgstr "能力遵循相同的工具策略：需要具备相应权限，会遵守权限回调，更改数据的能力需要明确批准。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1302
msgid "The WordPress Abilities API is not available on this site, so this option is inactive."
msgstr "此站点不支持 WordPress Abilities API，因此该选项不起作用。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1308
msgid "Register read-only content abilities plus draft creation"
msgstr "注册只读内容能力以及草稿创建能力"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1310
msgid "Registers search, read, SEO suggestion and WooCommerce product lookup as read-only abilities, plus one write ability that creates drafts. Nothing is published, updated or deleted, and orders and customers are never exposed."
msgstr "将搜索、读取、SEO 建议和 WooCommerce 产品查询注册为只读能力，另加一个创建草稿的写入能力。不会发布、更新或删除任何内容，也绝不会暴露订单和客户信息。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1312
msgid "Requires the WordPress Abilities API."
msgstr "需要 WordPress Abilities API。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1327
msgid "Add a writing assistant sidebar to the block editor"
msgstr "为区块编辑器添加写作助手侧边栏"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1328
msgid "Improve, shorten, expand, summarize, suggest titles or translate. Suggestions are never saved automatically and require the edit_posts capability."
msgstr "润色、缩写、扩写、总结、推荐标题或翻译。建议绝不会自动保存，并且需要 edit_posts 权限。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1334
msgid "Store questions and answers for review"
msgstr "存储问题和回答以供查看"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1335
msgid "Keep for"
msgstr "保留"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1335
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1353
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1529
msgid "days"
msgstr "天"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1337
msgid "Disabled by default. When enabled, chat content is stored in the database, capped at 200 recent entries, and visible to administrators. Disclose this to your visitors."
msgstr "默认停用。启用后，对话内容会存储在数据库中，最多保留最近 200 条，管理员可以查看。请告知你的访客。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1549
msgid "What are your opening hours?"
msgstr "你们的营业时间是什么时候？"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1550
msgid "One question per line, up to four. They appear as buttons above the input so visitors know what to ask, and disappear once the conversation starts."
msgstr "每行一个问题，最多四个。它们会以按钮形式显示在输入框上方，让访客知道可以问什么，并在对话开始后消失。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1558
msgid "Requests per minute for each role"
msgstr "每个角色的每分钟请求数"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1576
msgid "Optional. Leave a row empty to use the site-wide limit above. A visitor with several roles gets the most permissive of them, and requests are still counted per profile."
msgstr "可选。某一行留空则使用上方的全站限制。拥有多个角色的访客将采用其中最宽松的限制，且请求仍按对话配置分别计数。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1583
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1586
msgid "Optional. Point at a prompt in Amazon Bedrock Prompt Management and its text replaces the system prompt above, so one prompt can be reviewed in AWS and reused by every site. The prompt must live in the same region as the chat. Leave the version empty to follow the draft."
msgstr "可选。指向 Amazon Bedrock 提示词管理中的一个提示词，其文本将替换上方的系统提示词，这样同一个提示词可以在 AWS 中审核并被所有站点复用。该提示词必须位于与对话相同的区域。版本留空则跟随草稿。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1595
msgid "While the prompt cannot be read, the system prompt above is used instead."
msgstr "无法读取该提示词时，将改用上方的系统提示词。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1599
msgid "Prompt in use:"
msgstr "当前使用的提示词："

#. translators: %s: comma separated list of variable names.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1607
#, php-format
msgid "These variables are sent literally because this plugin cannot resolve them: %s"
msgstr "以下变量将按原样发送，因为此插件无法解析它们：%s"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1615
msgid "Off, use keyword search only"
msgstr "关闭，仅使用关键词搜索"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1617
msgid "Finds content by meaning instead of shared words. It adds one embedding request per question, plus one per passage while indexing. Keyword search still runs when nothing relevant is found. Only what a signed-out visitor can read is indexed."
msgstr "按含义而非共同词语查找内容。每个问题会增加一次嵌入请求，建立索引时每个段落也会增加一次。找不到相关内容时仍会执行关键词搜索。只有未登录访客可以阅读的内容才会被建立索引。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1621
msgid "Keep the index up to date in the background"
msgstr "在后台保持索引为最新"

#. translators: 1: indexed item count, 2: total published item count.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1633
#, php-format
msgid "Indexed %1$s of %2$s published item."
msgid_plural "Indexed %1$s of %2$s published items."
msgstr[0] "已为 %2$s 个已发布项目中的 %1$s 个建立索引。"

#. translators: %s: number of vectors waiting to be deleted.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1639
#, php-format
msgid "%s removed passage is still waiting to be deleted from S3 Vectors."
msgid_plural "%s removed passages are still waiting to be deleted from S3 Vectors."
msgstr[0] "仍有 %s 个已移除的段落等待从 S3 Vectors 中删除。"

#. translators: %s: number of items compared per question.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1649
#, php-format
msgid "With vectors stored in the WordPress database, each question is compared with the %s most recent items only. Choose Amazon S3 Vectors below to search everything."
msgstr "向量存储在 WordPress 数据库中时，每个问题只会与最近的 %s 个项目进行比较。在下方选择 Amazon S3 Vectors 即可搜索全部内容。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1656
msgid "Delete the index"
msgstr "删除索引"

#. translators: %s: human readable time until the next scheduled run.
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1663
#, php-format
msgid "Next background batch in %s. On a large site, run wp ai-chat-bedrock index once to finish faster."
msgstr "下一个后台批次将在 %s 后运行。大型站点可运行一次 wp ai-chat-bedrock index 以更快完成。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1667
msgid "The background run will be scheduled on the next page load."
msgstr "后台任务将在下次页面加载时安排。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1671
msgid "Indexing runs in small batches. Editing a post marks it for re-indexing on the next run."
msgstr "建立索引以小批次进行。编辑文章后，它会在下次运行时被重新建立索引。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1680
msgid "WordPress database (small sites)"
msgstr "WordPress 数据库（小型站点）"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1681
msgid "Amazon S3 Vectors"
msgstr "Amazon S3 Vectors"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1685
msgid "The database keeps one vector per post and compares a question with the most recent 500. Amazon S3 Vectors stores every passage of every post and searches all of them, at a cost per stored gigabyte and per query."
msgstr "数据库为每篇文章保存一个向量，并将问题与最近的 500 篇进行比较。Amazon S3 Vectors 会存储每篇文章的每个段落并搜索全部段落，按存储的每 GB 和每次查询计费。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1687
msgid "Vector bucket"
msgstr "向量存储桶"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1689
msgid "Vector index"
msgstr "向量索引"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1691
msgid "Region of the bucket"
msgstr "存储桶所在区域"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1692
msgid "Same as Amazon Bedrock"
msgstr "与 Amazon Bedrock 相同"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1694
msgid "Create the vector bucket in the Amazon S3 console, then check or create the index here. Several sites can share one index: each only reads and deletes its own vectors. Needs s3vectors:PutVectors, QueryVectors, GetVectors, DeleteVectors, ListVectors and GetIndex, plus CreateIndex to create it from here."
msgstr "请先在 Amazon S3 控制台中创建向量存储桶，然后在此处检查或创建索引。多个站点可以共享一个索引：每个站点只读取和删除自己的向量。需要 s3vectors:PutVectors、QueryVectors、GetVectors、DeleteVectors、ListVectors 和 GetIndex 权限；若要在此处创建索引，还需要 CreateIndex。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1697
msgid "Check the index"
msgstr "检查索引"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1697
msgid "Create the index"
msgstr "创建索引"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1702
msgid "Optional adjustments to plugins this site runs. Each is off until you turn it on, and does nothing while the plugin it adjusts is inactive."
msgstr "对此站点所用插件的可选调整。每项在你开启前均为关闭状态，且在所调整的插件未启用时不起任何作用。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1708
msgid "Ask GitHub for read-only access when visitors sign in with GitHub"
msgstr "访客通过 GitHub 登录时仅向 GitHub 请求只读访问权限"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1709
msgid "FluentAuth requests the \"user\" scope, which also lets the site change the visitor's GitHub profile. Signing in only needs read:user and user:email."
msgstr "FluentAuth 会请求“user”权限范围，这同时允许站点修改访客的 GitHub 个人资料。登录只需要 read:user 和 user:email。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1710
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1719
msgid "Requires FluentAuth."
msgstr "需要 FluentAuth。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1717
msgid "Sign up through social login only"
msgstr "仅允许通过社交登录注册"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1718
msgid "Social sign-up needs \"Anyone can register\", which also opens the WordPress registration form. That form emails a password link and attracts spam accounts. This sends it to the login page, where the social buttons are, and hides the Register link."
msgstr "社交注册需要开启“任何人都可以注册”，而这也会开放 WordPress 注册表单。该表单会通过电子邮件发送密码链接，并会招来垃圾账户。此选项会将其转到放有社交登录按钮的登录页面，并隐藏“注册”链接。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1730
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1738
msgid "Polylang lists each translation of a page for search engines but no x-default, so they guess which one to show a reader whose language the site does not have. The edition chosen here is named as the default."
msgstr "Polylang 会为搜索引擎列出页面的各个翻译版本，但不提供 x-default，因此当站点没有读者所用的语言时，搜索引擎只能猜测该显示哪个版本。此处选择的版本将被指定为默认版本。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1738
msgid "Requires Polylang."
msgstr "需要 Polylang。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1792
msgid "Credit articles to the organization"
msgstr "将文章作者署名为组织"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1793
msgid "Yoast SEO names the account that published a post as its author. When Yoast is set to represent an organization, this names the organization instead, in structured data, the author meta tag and Slack previews."
msgstr "Yoast SEO 会将发布文章的账户列为作者。当 Yoast 设置为代表组织时，此选项会改为将组织列为作者，适用于结构化数据、author meta 标签和 Slack 预览。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1794
msgid "Requires Yoast SEO."
msgstr "需要 Yoast SEO。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1799
msgid "Answers about products and orders from the store itself, and help writing product pages. Each is off until you turn it on."
msgstr "根据商店自身的数据回答商品和订单问题，并协助撰写商品页面。每项功能在您开启前均处于关闭状态。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1803
msgid "Answer product questions from the live catalog"
msgstr "根据实时商品目录回答商品问题"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1804
msgid "Matching products are looked up for each question, by name, description, SKU or category, and their current price, stock, rating and attributes are given to the model, so it does not quote an old price. The products are shown as cards under the answer, with a link to add simple products to the cart. On a product page, that product comes first. Products that are not published, are hidden from the shop or search, or are out of stock on a store that hides those, are never used."
msgstr "每个问题都会按名称、描述、SKU 或分类查找匹配的商品，并将其当前价格、库存、评分和属性提供给模型，因此不会报出过时的价格。商品以卡片形式显示在回答下方，简单商品附有加入购物车的链接。在商品页面上，该商品排在最前。未发布的商品、在商店或搜索中隐藏的商品，以及商店设置为隐藏缺货商品时的缺货商品，均不会被使用。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1809
msgid "More products give the model more to compare but increase input tokens and cost."
msgstr "商品越多，模型可比较的内容越多，但输入 Token 和费用也会增加。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1813
msgid "Let signed-in customers ask about their own orders"
msgstr "允许已登录的顾客查询自己的订单"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1814
msgid "Only when a question is about orders, shipping or returns, the customer's five latest orders are given to the model: number, dates, status, items, total, shipping method and tracking number. Addresses, email, phone and payment details are never sent, and nobody can see another customer's orders. This sends customer data to Amazon Bedrock, so add the suggested text under Settings, Privacy, Policy Guide to your privacy policy first."
msgstr "仅当问题涉及订单、配送或退货时，才会将该顾客最近的五个订单提供给模型：订单号、日期、状态、商品、总额、配送方式和运单号。地址、电子邮件、电话和支付信息绝不会发送，任何人都看不到其他顾客的订单。此功能会将顾客数据发送到 Amazon Bedrock，因此请先将“设置 > 隐私 > 政策指南”中的建议文字加入您的隐私政策。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1818
msgid "Draft product descriptions and summarize reviews"
msgstr "起草商品描述并汇总评价"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1819
msgid "Adds a box to the product edit screen that writes the short and the full description from the product's own attributes, categories and text, without inventing specifications, and sums up what reviews praise and criticize, without reviewer names. Drafts go into the editor for you to review and are saved only when you update the product."
msgstr "在商品编辑页面添加一个面板，根据商品自身的属性、分类和文字撰写简短描述和完整描述，不会编造规格；并汇总评价中的好评与批评，不含评价者姓名。草稿会放入编辑器供您审阅，只有在您更新商品时才会保存。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1836
msgid "Generate image alt text and post excerpts"
msgstr "生成图片替代文本和文章摘要"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1837
msgid "Adds a Generate alt text action to the media library and an excerpt helper for posts. Alt text needs a model that accepts images, such as Claude. Existing alt text is never replaced unless you ask."
msgstr "在媒体库中添加“生成替代文本”操作，并为文章添加摘要助手。替代文本需要支持图片输入的模型，例如 Claude。除非你要求，否则绝不会替换已有的替代文本。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1842
msgid "The list is discovered from your AWS account and region. Many current models require a cross-region inference profile ID."
msgstr "此列表根据你的 AWS 账户和区域获取。许多最新模型需要使用跨区域推理配置文件 ID。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1843
msgid "Refresh model list"
msgstr "刷新模型列表"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1846
msgid "No fallback"
msgstr "不使用备用模型"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1848
msgid "Used only when the main model cannot answer because access was denied, the request was throttled, or Amazon Bedrock was unreachable. The reply states which model answered. Requests rejected for other reasons are never retried."
msgstr "仅在主模型因访问被拒绝、请求被限流或无法连接 Amazon Bedrock 而无法回答时使用。回复中会注明由哪个模型回答。因其他原因被拒绝的请求绝不会重试。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1869
msgid "Not sent to Claude Opus 4.7, Sonnet 5, Opus 5 and newer Claude models, because Amazon Bedrock rejects it for them."
msgstr "不会发送给 Claude Opus 4.7、Sonnet 5、Opus 5 及更新的 Claude 模型，因为 Amazon Bedrock 会拒绝这些模型的该参数。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1882
msgid "Allow unauthenticated visitors to use paid Bedrock requests"
msgstr "允许未登录的访客使用付费的 Bedrock 请求"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1883
msgid "Disabled by default. Enabling this can incur AWS charges even with rate limiting."
msgstr "默认停用。即使启用了频率限制，开启此选项也可能产生 AWS 费用。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1892
msgid "Show a floating chat button on every page"
msgstr "在每个页面显示浮动对话按钮"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1894
#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-profiles.php:63
