msgstr "Amazon Rerank 1.0（美国东部（弗吉尼亚北部）不提供）"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1085
#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1347
msgid "Conversation memory"
msgstr "对话记忆"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1343
msgid "Off (default): each page starts a new conversation"
msgstr "关闭（默认）：每个页面都开始新的对话"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1344
msgid "Keep it while the visitor browses, in their browser tab"
msgstr "在访客浏览期间保留在其浏览器标签页中"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1345
msgid "Also save it for signed-in visitors, across visits and devices"
msgstr "同时为已登录访客保存，跨访问和设备可用"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1353
msgid "Keep saved conversations for"
msgstr "已保存对话的保留期限"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1355
msgid "Kept in the browser tab, the conversation is stored only in the visitor's browser and is gone when the tab is closed. Saved for signed-in visitors, it is also stored on this site with their account, included in personal data exports and erasures, and deleted after the days above. Clear in the chat deletes it, and switching saving off deletes every saved conversation. Disclose this to your visitors."
msgstr "保留在浏览器标签页中时，对话只存储在访客的浏览器里，关闭标签页后即消失。为已登录访客保存时，对话还会随其账户存储在本站，包含在个人数据导出和抹除中，并在上述天数后删除。在聊天中点击清除会删除对话，关闭保存功能会删除所有已保存的对话。请向访客说明这一点。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-chat-history.php:341
#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-chat-history.php:355
#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-chat-history.php:377
