msgstr "当您按下回答下方的“收听”时，该回答的文本会发送到 Amazon Web Services 的服务 Amazon Polly 进行朗读。音频在您的浏览器中播放，不会保存在本站。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-woocommerce.php:1395
msgid "Posts can be read aloud by Amazon Polly. Only the published text of the post is sent, never anything about you, and the audio is kept on this site until the post changes."
msgstr "文章可以由 Amazon Polly 朗读。只会发送文章已发布的文本，绝不会发送任何有关您的信息，音频会保存在本站，直到文章变更。"

