msgstr "向智能体描述本站，并为段落标注类型和语言"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1318
msgid "Adds a read-only describe-site ability and MCP tool. It lists what the site holds as schema.org types, with counts per language, how they relate and which data an AI may see, using the same IDs as Yoast SEO and WooCommerce. Passages given to the model also say whether they come from a post, page or product, and in which language. Only published, public content is described."
msgstr "添加只读的 describe-site 能力和 MCP 工具。它以 schema.org 类型列出本站包含的内容，附各语言的数量、类型之间的关系，以及 AI 可以看到哪些数据，并使用与 Yoast SEO 和 WooCommerce 相同的 ID。交给模型的段落也会注明来自文章、页面还是商品，以及使用哪种语言。只描述已发布的公开内容。"

