#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-diagnostics.php:86
msgid "Amazon Bedrock turns a model on for the AWS account the first time it is called. That first call subscribes to most third-party models through AWS Marketplace, which this policy does not allow, since the site needs it only once. The simplest way through is to open the model once in the Amazon Bedrock console playground, signed in as an administrator, in the region above. Anthropic models also ask for a one-time use case form there."
msgstr "Amazon Bedrock 会在某个模型第一次被调用时为该 AWS 账户开启它。对大多数第三方模型来说，这第一次调用会通过 AWS Marketplace 订阅该模型，而此策略并不允许这样做，因为站点只需要做一次。最简单的办法是以管理员身份登录，在上面的区域中于 Amazon Bedrock 控制台的操作台（playground）里打开该模型一次。Anthropic 模型还会在那里要求填写一次性的用例表单。"

#: admin/partials/ai-chat-bedrock-admin-diagnostics.php:92
msgid "ValidationException or model not found: confirm the region offers the model and whether a cross-region inference profile ID is required."
msgstr "ValidationException 或找不到模型：确认该区域提供此模型，以及是否需要使用跨区域推理配置文件 ID。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-bedrock-errors.php:120
msgid "Anthropic asks each AWS account to describe its use case once before its models can be used. Open any Anthropic model in the Amazon Bedrock console model catalog and submit the form; access usually follows within 15 minutes. Models from other providers do not need it."
msgstr "Anthropic 要求每个 AWS 账户在使用其模型之前先说明一次用例。请在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台的模型目录中打开任意一个 Anthropic 模型并提交表单，通常 15 分钟内即可使用。其他提供商的模型不需要这一步。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-bedrock-errors.php:130
msgid "The AWS account has no valid payment method for AWS Marketplace, through which most third-party models are sold. Add one in the AWS Billing console, or choose an Amazon Nova model, which does not need it."
msgstr "该 AWS 账户没有可用于 AWS Marketplace 的有效付款方式，而大多数第三方模型都是通过它销售的。请在 AWS Billing 控制台中添加付款方式，或选择不需要它的 Amazon Nova 模型。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-bedrock-errors.php:143
msgid "This model has not been used in the AWS account before, and the first use has to subscribe to it through AWS Marketplace, which this AWS identity may not do. Have an administrator open the model once in the Amazon Bedrock console playground, or allow aws-marketplace:Subscribe, aws-marketplace:Unsubscribe and aws-marketplace:ViewSubscriptions for one request. Access can take up to 15 minutes to follow."
msgstr "此 AWS 账户以前没有使用过这个模型，第一次使用时需要通过 AWS Marketplace 订阅它，而当前的 AWS 身份无权这样做。请让管理员在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台的操作台（playground）中打开该模型一次，或者为一次请求允许 aws-marketplace:Subscribe、aws-marketplace:Unsubscribe 和 aws-marketplace:ViewSubscriptions。开通可能需要最多 15 分钟。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-bedrock-errors.php:154
msgid "This AWS account does not have access to the model yet. Open the model once in the Amazon Bedrock console playground, in this region, which turns it on or says what is missing."
msgstr "此 AWS 账户还不能使用该模型。请在此区域的 Amazon Bedrock 控制台操作台（playground）中打开该模型一次，这会开启它，或者告诉你缺少什么。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-bedrock-errors.php:170
msgid "Amazon Bedrock refused the request. Attach the generated IAM policy from the Diagnostics screen, and open the model once in the Amazon Bedrock console playground in this region to confirm the account can use it."
msgstr "Amazon Bedrock 拒绝了该请求。请附加“诊断”页面生成的 IAM 策略，并在此区域的 Amazon Bedrock 控制台操作台（playground）中打开该模型一次，确认账户可以使用它。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-diagnostics.php:170
msgid "The selected model was not returned by the region catalog. Confirm the region offers it and whether an inference profile ID is required."
msgstr "所选模型不在该区域的目录中。请确认该区域提供此模型，以及是否需要推理配置文件 ID。"

