msgid "Saved audio plays for everyone at no cost. Crawlers and scripts cannot have posts read. Without a daily limit for the site, visitors have none either."
msgstr "已保存的音频对所有人播放，不产生费用。爬虫和脚本无法触发文章朗读。网站未设置每日上限时，访客也没有上限。"

