msgstr "也使用已设置为禁止搜索引擎收录（noindex）的页面来回答"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1266
msgid "Off by default. A page kept out of search engines, such as a thank-you page with a download or a campaign landing page, is usually kept out for a reason, so the chat and agents leave it out too. The noindex settings of Yoast SEO, Rank Math and SEOPress are read for each page and post type; All in One SEO for each page. Reading a post aloud is not affected."
msgstr "默认关闭。不让搜索引擎收录的页面（例如带下载链接的感谢页或营销落地页）通常有其原因，因此对话和智能体也会跳过它们。会读取 Yoast SEO、Rank Math 和 SEOPress 对每个页面和内容类型的 noindex 设置，以及 All in One SEO 对每个页面的设置。文章朗读不受影响。"

