msgstr "抱歉，暂时无法生成回答，请稍后再试。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-woocommerce.php:1420
msgid "If you write to this site's WeChat Official Account, WeChat, a service of Tencent, passes your messages to this site, and they are sent to Amazon Bedrock to write the answer. Your last few messages and the answers are kept on this site for 30 minutes, under a code made from your WeChat ID, so that a follow-up question can be understood. If the site keeps a conversation log, your questions are stored there too, without your WeChat ID."
msgstr "如果你给本站的微信公众号发消息，腾讯提供的微信服务会把消息转给本站，再发送到 Amazon Bedrock 生成回答。你最近的几条消息和回答会以由你的微信 ID 生成的代码为键，在本站保存 30 分钟，以便理解后续问题。如果本站开启了对话日志，你的问题也会保存在日志中，但不包含你的微信 ID。"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1393
msgid "Model for WeChat"
msgstr "微信使用的模型"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1394
