msgstr "与对话相同"

#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1409
msgid "The chat answers each text message from the site's pages, in plain text with its sources. WeChat waits about fifteen seconds in all; a longer answer is kept and the follower is told to send 1 to see it, so choose a fast model for WeChat if the chat's takes longer. A new follower gets the welcome message and suggested questions. Every answer counts towards the daily request limit, and the conversation log records them when it is on."
msgstr "对话会根据网站页面回答每条文字消息，以纯文本形式附上来源。微信总共等待约 15 秒；更久的回答会被保存，并提示粉丝发送 1 查看，因此如果对话使用的模型较慢，请为微信选择一个更快的模型。新粉丝会收到欢迎语和推荐问题。每个回答都计入每日请求上限，开启对话日志时也会记录。"

