#, php-format
msgid "Off until a channel is connected. In Google Cloud, enable the YouTube Data API v3, create an OAuth client of type Web application with the authorized redirect URI %s, and enter its ID and secret here; then connect the channel. Uploads run in the background from the Published elsewhere box of a post, with the publishing record on, and are added to it. Google keeps videos uploaded from a project that has not passed YouTube's audit private, and each upload uses 1,600 of the 10,000 quota units a project gets a day."
msgstr "连接频道前不会启用。在 Google Cloud 中启用 YouTube Data API v3，创建一个“Web 应用”类型的 OAuth 客户端，已获授权的重定向 URI 填写 %s，再把它的 ID 和密钥填在这里，然后连接频道。开启发布记录后，可在文章的“已在其他平台发布”框中发起上传，上传在后台进行并加入记录。未通过 YouTube 审核的 Google Cloud 项目上传的视频会被保持为私享；每次上传消耗项目每天 10,000 配额单位中的 1,600 个。"

