#: admin/class-ai-chat-bedrock-admin.php:1414
msgid "Off by default. Bilibili opens its publishing API only to registered companies and Xiaohongshu has none for creators, so there a person publishes. With this on, the Published elsewhere box writes the Bilibili, Xiaohongshu and YouTube title, text, tags and category from the text a signed-out visitor reads, within each platform's limits and in the post's language, with links to each creator page and the cover. After publishing, enter the address in the same box to record it. Each kit is one model request; agents can ask for one through an ability. The copy is an AI draft: check it, and declare AI assistance with the platform's label."
msgstr "默认关闭。B 站只向已注册企业开放发布接口，小红书没有面向创作者的发布接口，所以这两个平台由人来发布。开启后，“已在其他平台发布”框会根据未登录访客可见的正文，按各平台的限制、用文章的语言，撰写 B 站、小红书和 YouTube 的标题、正文、标签和分区，并附上各平台创作页面和封面的链接。发布后，在同一框中填写地址即可记录。每个素材包调用一次模型；Agent 也可以通过能力（Ability）请求。文案是 AI 草稿：请核对，并用平台自带的标识声明使用了 AI 辅助。"

