#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-wechat-drafts.php:1254
msgid "No longer in the WeChat draft box: published or deleted there. Send the post again to make a new draft."
msgstr "已不在微信草稿箱中：已在微信中发表或删除。如需新草稿，请再次发送这篇文章。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-wechat-drafts.php:1608
msgid "No post could be made into an article: each must be published, readable by anyone, and have a featured image or an image in the text, in JPEG or PNG."
msgstr "没有文章能生成图文：每篇都必须已发布、所有人可读，并且有 JPEG 或 PNG 格式的特色图片或正文图片。"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-wechat-game.php:652
msgid "a plaintext message was refused, because the mini game is set for safe mode (it has an EncodingAESKey, or shares the Official Account's token); choose safe mode in WeChat"
msgstr "一条明文消息被拒绝，因为小游戏设定为安全模式（已填写 EncodingAESKey，或与公众号共用令牌）；请在微信后台选择安全模式"

#: includes/class-ai-chat-bedrock-wechat.php:285
msgid "a plaintext message was refused, because an EncodingAESKey is set: choose safe mode in WeChat, or remove the key here"
msgstr "一条明文消息被拒绝，因为已填写 EncodingAESKey：请在微信后台选择安全模式，或在这里删除该密钥"

